      "result": "The standalone notice identifies newly written source-assisted compatibility code, the pinned release/commit, retained Microsoft notices, and no clean-room/full-API claim. Its exact 1088-byte Microsoft license is the complete notice suffix at byte offset 593. The preserved original license hashes to 9480271317925265e806a9a196aaa33410a962fa9d4d1e248a4a5187bc8c9df9. All six original implementation source files retain the Microsoft copyright/MIT header at lines 1-4 and match the provenance byte hashes. This is a notice-presence and byte-identity check, not a legal opinion.",
